DefundCallbackAll_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when callback owned by another vault
│  └── it should revert with InvalidCallback
└── when callback owned by vault
   ├── given idToMarketParams returns zero loanToken
   │  └── it should revert with UnknownMarket
   └── given known market
      ├── given callback has no supply position
      │  └── it should revert with NoPosition
      ├── given withdrawn assets exceed deployedAssets
      │  └── it should floor deployedAssets at zero
      └── given callback has supply position
         ├── it should withdraw all callback shares
         ├── it should send assets to vault
         └── it should subtract assets from deployedAssets
